          "type": "copy",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow_text": "",
            "show_eyebrow_arrow": false,
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>Kylie, a long-standing fan of Entire Studios, first partnered with Sebastian Hunt and Dylan Richards-Diaz, the founding duo behind the LA-based label, to create a thoughtfully edited assortment of contemporary outerwear for Khy. The original collection, which was centered around puffers, honored the niche category that catapulted Entire Studios to popularity amongst fashion tastemakers and A-list celebrities. This new season of Khy x Entire Studios, on the other hand, demonstrates how Kylie, Sebastian, and Dylan translate a modern luxury design aesthetic across a diverse range of silhouettes and fabrications. “Since our first collaboration, both Khy and Entire Studios have grown and evolved immensely in terms of design and honing in on our brand identities,” Dylan notes. “It’s exciting to be able to share our continually evolving techniques and silhouettes with Khy's audience.”</p>",
            "horizontal_align_md": "left",
            "horizontal_align": "left",
            "vertical_align_md": "middle",
            "countdown_text": "see you in",
