            "show_eyebrow_arrow": false,
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>The luxury-infused collection—featuring fourteen styles, including tops, pants, dresses, skirts, and coats—exudes a subtle boldness. The pieces find balance between harsh and soft, reflecting the quiet power of the people who wear them. “All of the silhouettes are timeless and versatile while also being incredibly unique and captivating, which is something I’ve always really admired about Entire Studios’ designs,” Kylie explains. “It’s been so special working with Sebastian and Dylan again and I’m so proud of what we’ve created together.” </p><p><br/>As Sebastian describes, \"Growing alongside each other while maintaining our mutual core mission of making luxury accessible means it's always easy to work together and to create in a collaborative and fulfilling way.”</p>",
